to move the mouse with freelook. I didn't manage to find precise reproduction steps for this.\r\n\r\nPossibly due to the editor not requesting an update when it should (or the change being deferred to _after_ the next frame has been drawn for some reason).\r\n\r\n> The changes to AnimationPlayer and AnimationTree from the Godot 3 version of this PR are present, but the behavior seems different. I'm having trouble evaluating the desired behavior, is this something I should put more time into fixing?\r\n\r\nIf you put a breakpoint on the `changes_changed()` bit, you can work out what is triggering the update.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3591539707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3704233898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113224#issuecomment-3704233898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113224","id":3704233898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cyh-q","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.git